  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dfe0dfdc-3bea-40f7-be45-49dc911009c4\" alt=\"横幅\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.justus0405.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1370519315400495234?logo=Discord&colorA=1e1e2e&colorB=a6e3a1&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/v/787912?style=for-the-badge&colorA=1e1e2e&colorB=f38ba8\" alt=\"\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/justus0405/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/787912?logo=Curseforge&colorA=1e1e2e&colorB=fab387&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2><strong>无尽新地平线</strong></h2>\n<p>为新手打造的轻量级模组体验，内含<strong>500 多个任务</strong>！</p>\n<p>本整合包针对<strong>低配电脑</strong>进行了优化，并已在配备奔腾处理器和英特尔高清显卡的系统中测试通过（客户端与服务器端均可）。</p>\n<h2><strong>适用于 Forge 1.16.5 的整合包</strong></h2>\n<p>为了获得最佳性能，建议分配至少<strong>4GB 内存</strong>，<strong>6GB</strong> 为佳。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>注意：</strong>本整合包已预装<strong>Embeddium</strong>，无需单独安装 OptiFine。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>有问题？</h2>\n<p><strong>需要帮助？加入我的 Discord！</strong>有任何问题、建议或反馈？欢迎留言或分享你的想法！</p>\n<p><strong>模组列表：</strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f56191%252fendless-new-horizons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看模组列表</a></p>",
